# Toolchain pins for tools that mise manages.
#
# This file is read by mise, so it must only name tools mise can resolve.
# Naming one it cannot, such as psql, makes mise emit a warning on every
# single command run in this directory, which is worse than not pinning it.
# Database client versions are therefore recorded separately, in
# .db-versions, and verified by the same script.
#
# Verified by "make toolchain", which compares these pins against what is
# actually installed.

# Go is pinned to the minor line, not to a patch. go.mod declares "go 1.27",
# which is a language version and a compatibility floor, and setup-go resolves it
# to the newest 1.27.x rather than to one patch. Claiming 1.27.0 here would state
# a precision that nothing actually enforces, and this file is meant to be
# believed.
golang  1.27
nodejs  26.7.0
bun     1.3.13
